# My Barber — Monorepo Core

## Tooling

- **pnpm only** (`pnpm@10.33.2`). Never npm or yarn.
- **turbo** for cross-package tasks: `pnpm turbo run build|dev|lint|typecheck|test|clean`
- **Node 20.x** (`.nvmrc`). pnpm linker is **hoisted** — required for Expo Metro; do not switch to isolated without re-testing mobile.

## Layout

| Path | Package | Stack |
|------|---------|-------|
| `apps/mobile` | `@my-barber/mobile` | Expo SDK 54+ / Restyle / React Query / Zustand |
| `apps/web` | `@my-barber/web` | Next.js 16 static export / Tailwind v4 |
| `apps/admin` | `@my-barber/admin` | Next.js 16 / TailAdmin / port 3001 |
| `packages/types` | `@my-barber/types` | Zod schemas + inferred types |
| `packages/config` | `@my-barber/config` | env, constants, Firestore collection names |
| `backend/api` | `@my-barber/api` | Express + Firestore on Vercel |

## Cross-cutting rules

- Shared API contracts → `@my-barber/types` (import, don't redefine).
- Firestore collection names → `COLLECTIONS` from `@my-barber/config` (never hardcode).
- Firebase Admin → `getFirebaseAdmin()` from `@my-barber/config/firebase` (server only).
- Auth is **custom JWT + bcrypt** — not Firebase Auth ID tokens.
- `backend/api` is Express on Vercel, not Firebase Cloud Functions.
- New env vars → `packages/config/src/env.ts` + relevant `.env.example`.
- Do not hand-edit `packages/ui/` until Open Design MCP has generated components.
- Never commit real env files or secrets (`.env`, `.env.*.local`).

## Commits & verification

- Conventional Commits: `feat:`, `fix:`, `chore:`, `docs:`, `refactor:`, `test:`, `ci:` (optional scope: `fix(mobile): …`).
- Before PR: `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile && pnpm turbo run typecheck lint build`
- Per-app dev: `pnpm --filter=@my-barber/<app> dev`

